FUNDAMENTALS (1964 analog-computing language)
  Ideal op-amp:  Av -> infinity,  Zin -> infinity,  Zout -> 0,  virtual ground at (-) input
  Closed-loop behavior set by feedback network, not the amplifier itself
  e  = output voltage          ei, e1..e4 = input voltages
  i  = current                 Q  = charge
  R, Rf, C = passive elements  p  = Laplace operator (s)
  alpha, n, k = scale / ratio factors
  Typical models referenced: P2A, SP2A, P45, P55A (solid-state modular op-amps)

